---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { projects, experience, education } from '../data/career';
const featuredProjects = projects.slice(0, 3);
const featuredRoles = experience.slice(0, 3);
---
<Layout title="Teja K G | Manufacturing Engineer, Automation & Engineering Productivity" description="Teja K G is a VCP Design Engineer - Mechanical at GE HealthCare in Bengaluru, combining manufacturing engineering, productivity, automation, electronics and verification & validation for complex hardware.">
  <section class="hero hero-clean" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">VCP Design Engineer - Mechanical · Bengaluru</div>
      <h1 id="hero-title">I build engineering solutions that make manufacturing faster, smarter and more reliable.</h1>
      <p class="lede">I combine mechanical engineering, manufacturing productivity, automation, electronics and software to solve complex problems in <strong>medical devices and semiconductor equipment</strong>.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/projects/">View selected work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button" href="/experience/">Experience</a><a class="text-link" href="/resume/">Résumé →</a></div>
      <div class="hero-meta"><span>GE HealthCare</span><span>Lam Research</span><span>Medical Devices</span><span>Semiconductor Equipment</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-portrait-wrap">
      <div class="hero-portrait"><img src="/teja-headshot.svg" width="469" height="480" alt="Professional portrait of Teja K G" fetchpriority="high" /></div>
      <div class="portrait-caption"><div><strong>Teja K G</strong><span>Manufacturing · Automation · Engineering Productivity</span></div><div><span>Bengaluru, India</span><span>GE HealthCare</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="proof-band" aria-label="Measured engineering impact">
    <div><strong>90%</strong><span>cycle-time reduction</span><small>IMU-based fixture</small></div>
    <div><strong>$1M+</strong><span>annual savings</span><small>productivity improvement</small></div>
    <div><strong>50%</strong><span>test-cycle reduction</span><small>Python automation</small></div>
    <div><strong>30%</strong><span>less trial-and-error</span><small>DELMIA simulation</small></div>
  </section>

  <section class="approach-section" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
    <div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">How I work</div><h2 id="approach-title">A simple engineering loop.</h2></div><p>I start with the physical constraint, quantify it, choose the right intervention, prove it on real hardware, and make the gain repeatable.</p></div>
    <div class="approach-grid">
      <article><b>01</b><h3>Observe</h3><p>Find the actual manufacturing constraint.</p></article>
      <article><b>02</b><h3>Measure</h3><p>Quantify time, cost, quality or risk.</p></article>
      <article><b>03</b><h3>Engineer</h3><p>Design the right mechanical or process intervention.</p></article>
      <article><b>04</b><h3>Automate</h3><p>Use sensing, software or automation where it removes effort.</p></article>
      <article><b>05</b><h3>Validate</h3><p>Prove the change with real hardware and evidence.</p></article>
      <article><b>06</b><h3>Standardize</h3><p>Turn the improvement into a repeatable process.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="case-title">
    <div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">Engineering in practice</div><h2 id="case-title">One problem. One clear result.</h2></div><p>The IMU fixture is the best example of how the engineering approach above translates into a manufacturing result.</p></div>
    <div class="case-layout">
      <div class="case-story"><span>IMU-BASED FIXTURE</span><h3>The problem was mechanical. The measurement was digital.</h3><p>The top-plate shaft could jam in the chamber hole, creating rework and line-down risk. I ideated, designed and developed a fixture using IMU sensing to determine absolute top-plate/chamber position and identify planar misalignment.</p><p>Assembly technicians then used the fixture repeatedly on the manufacturing line, followed by time and labour-hour validation against the original process.</p><a class="button" href="/projects/#imu-fixture">Read the case study →</a></div>
      <div class="case-result-large"><span>RESULT</span><strong>90%</strong><p>cycle-time reduction</p><hr/><strong>$1M+</strong><p>annual savings</p><hr/><p>Jam-driven line-down condition eliminated.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="bring-title">
    <div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">What I bring</div><h2 id="bring-title">Depth in manufacturing. Range across disciplines.</h2></div><p>The differentiator is not one tool. It is knowing when a mechanical, electrical, software or validation approach is the right answer.</p></div>
    <div class="bring-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Manufacturing Productivity</h3><p>Cycle-time reduction, process improvement, fixture development and cost reduction.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Automation &amp; Software</h3><p>Python, hardware test automation, computer vision and AI-assisted workflows.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Complex Hardware</h3><p>Mechanical + electronics + software across physical systems and manufacturing processes.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Regulated &amp; High-Reliability</h3><p>Medical devices, semiconductor equipment, V&amp;V, supplier engineering and risk retirement.</p></article></div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">Selected work</div><h2 id="work-title">Evidence, not a keyword wall.</h2></div><p>Three examples here. The full project section contains the deeper technical stories.</p></div>
    <div class="project-grid">{featuredProjects.map((project,index)=><article class="project"><div class="project-top"><span class="project-index">0{index+1}</span><span class="eyebrow">{project.tag}</span></div><h3>{project.title}</h3><p>{project.problem}</p><p class="result">{project.result}</p><a class="project-link" href={project.href}>Open project →</a></article>)}</div>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/projects/">See all engineering work →</a></div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="experience-title">
    <div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">Experience</div><h2 id="experience-title">Semiconductor equipment to medical imaging.</h2></div><p>Five years across manufacturing engineering, product engineering, supplier programs and verification &amp; validation.</p></div>
    <div class="timeline">{featuredRoles.map((role,index)=><article class="role"><div class="meta"><span class="role-index">0{index+1}</span><strong>{role.company}</strong><br/>{role.period}<br/>{role.location}</div><div><h3>{role.role}</h3><p>{role.summary}</p></div></article>)}</div>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/experience/">View full timeline →</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="compact-credentials" aria-labelledby="credentials-title"><div><div class="section-kicker">Credentials</div><h2 id="credentials-title">Mechanical engineering foundation.</h2></div><p><strong>{education.degree}</strong>, {education.specialization} · {education.institution} · {education.location} · {education.year}</p></section>

  <section class="final-cta"><div class="contact"><div><div class="section-kicker">Next</div><h2>Let's talk about the engineering problem.</h2></div><div><p class="lede">Based in Bengaluru. Open to roles where manufacturing engineering, automation and engineering productivity intersect.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="mailto:teja@gowlla.in">Email me</a><a class="button" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tejakg/">LinkedIn</a><a class="button" href="/resume/">Résumé</a></div></div></div></section>
</Layout>
